<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 4.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    96/98    103/105     UNQ     193/196</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   99/101   106/107   190/195   205/210</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices continued to climb on firm fuel oil market and suppliers were ready to raise their prices even further, traders said on Tuesday. A major sold 900 tonnes of 180-cst grade at $106.5 per tonne. &quot;Those who sold at low prices may regret tomorrow,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870 3571)</p>
</text>
